{"id":"665030","name":"葱烧木耳","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/665030/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"水发木耳","amount":"250g"},{"name":"大葱","amount":"100g"}],"sub":[{"name":"水淀粉","amount":"10g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"水发木耳备用。","img":"images/665030/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"水发木耳洗净，撕成小朵。","img":"images/665030/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅置火上，将泡好的木耳放沸水中焯熟，盛出，沥干，放入盘中。","img":"images/665030/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"大葱备用。","img":"images/665030/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"大葱择洗干净，切丝。","img":"images/665030/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"水淀粉备用。","img":"images/665030/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"另起锅，放油烧热，放入葱丝炒出香味，加入木耳翻炒，加生抽和盐调味，出锅前淋入水淀粉勾芡即可。","img":"images/665030/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"装盘即食。","img":"images/665030/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"葱香浓郁，脆而可口。","img":"images/665030/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}